*R This module restores the Mac Plus Control Manager.
*R The original comments describe the retained routines and data structures.
*R Later color, layer, 32-bit, cache, and scrolling-delay paths are omitted.
*R The ROM uses direct master-pointer locks and the earlier port-rectangle test.
*R See Evidence/controlmgr.json for provenance and the byte comparison.

;
;	File:		ControlMgr.a
;
;	Contains:	Control Manager for Macintosh User Interface ToolBox
;
;	Written by:	Andy Hertzfeld	August 4, 1982
;
;	Copyright:	© 1982-1993 by Apple Computer, Inc., all rights reserved.
;
